# Issue #2666 finding 5 (greenfield flag day): a leave request now signs the
# Members head its member saw, so administrators can refuse one from a
# membership that has since ended. Old clients cannot file a request the API
# accepts, and the directory's leave request gains the same required field.
# Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new contract.
PUT /organization-memberships/{organizationId}/leave-request added the new required request property `membersHead`

# Issue #2666 finding 5: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /organizations/{organizationId}/read-model added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the response body `oneOf` list for the response status `200`
